{"ID":"20240118145011-5xcugwr","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145011-5xcugwr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145011-5xcugwr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145011-dqeitex\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240204145438-2hmmui9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:69,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122162508-fw9h0lt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:270,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:270\u0026#125;","title":"336蛇蜕","type":"doc","updated":"20240204145441"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145011-dqeitex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145011-dqeitex","updated":"20240204145129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，平，无毒。治小儿百二十种惊痫，瘈瘲，癫疾，寒热，肠痔，虫毒，蛇痫。生川谷及田野。一名龙子衣，一名蛇符，一名龙子单衣，一名弓皮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162420-o35q1iw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162420-o35q1iw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，多蜕于石上及人家墙屋间，白色如银者入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162422-ykyyg4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162422-ykyyg4m"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味咸甘，性平，无毒（或作小毒）。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162424-ypmfppk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162424-ypmfppk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】蛇蜕主瘈瘲癫疾，弄舌摇头，治皮肤疥癣疮疡，明目退翳。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162426-0kfl0zn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162426-0kfl0zn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】大人五邪，言语僻越，止呕逆，明目，烧之疗诸恶疮。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162427-8vypkkn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162427-8vypkkn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】喉痹，百鬼魅。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162428-16tq1z0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162428-16tq1z0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】炙用辟恶，止小儿惊悸客热，煎汁傅疬疡，白瘢风，摧生。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162430-kxgawvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162430-kxgawvi"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【孟铣】安胎。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162431-t1ql5e0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162431-t1ql5e0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至一钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162433-wdu4c1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162433-wdu4c1k"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】性走窜，凡小儿惊痫癫疾，非外邪客忤而由肝心虚者忌用，孕妇忌之，畏磁石及酒，得火熬之良。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162418-qu86ycs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162418-qu86ycs"}},{"ID":"20240122162435-rmbktiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162435-rmbktiu"}},{"ID":"20240122162435-z4ip9ku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162435-z4ip9ku","updated":"20240204145217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看这个蛇蜕，就是蛇的皮嘛，这个蛇蜕呢，质非常的轻，风一吹就不见了，跑掉了。蛇蜕，336，我们用来治疗皮肤病，常常跟蝉蜕在一起并用。性味，味咸甘，性平无毒，你看主治，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"蛇蜕主瘛疭、癫疾、癫痫"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，小孩子弄舌头，摇头晃脑，现在不是Tourettr证（抽动秽语综合征），摇头晃脑，像那个耸肩呐，就是晃来晃去，蛇蜕啊，还有，这个小朋友还有口吐脏话，没办法控制，就在那边讲，哦..."}]},{"ID":"20240122162459-5udfczf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162459-5udfczf","updated":"20240204145306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蛇蜕，蛇蜕是专门用在小儿科方面的。你看皮肤的疥疮，蛇蜕非常好用，但希望你在煮蛇蜕，下蛇蜕的时候，你让那个蛇蜕用棉布把它包起来，包起来并不是蛇蜕需要包，而是浮在表面上太可怕。哎，怎么有蛇在里面？可能煮药煮到一半，蛇跑进去，所以还是用棉布把它包起来，不用给他看到，非常好用，我用了很多。处方的时候，你不会重用1钱吧？5分，就已经很多了，3分、5分就可以了，小朋友的话，像小孩子的话，1分、2分就，因为很轻嘛，质非常的轻，所以，小朋友受到惊吓，包括甚至扁桃腺炎都有人用到蛇蜕哦，皮肤病、皮肤痒，癫痫、发癫都可以，眼睛的问题通通可以使用，因为蜕就是褪下来的皮，你看眼睛里面生眼翳，可以用蛇蜕退掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240122162508-fw9h0lt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162508-fw9h0lt","updated":"20240204145441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】：大人五邪，言语僻越"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是讲话——什么脏话都骂出来了，平常不是那样子的人，你说老师那不是神经病吗，现在口秽症有没有，口秽症啊，西药厂很喜欢取这个名称，这样他才可以卖药，然后开的口秽症的药也是些镇静神经的药，那我们用蛇蜕。禁忌呢，诸位看：性走窜，凡小儿惊痫癫疾，由肝脏引起的，肝心虚，肝脏引起的禁忌，妇女孕妇禁忌，那怎么知道是肝脏引起的，一般，如果说前面有发过黄，还有小朋友不能安眠，晚上睡不熟，睡不是很好，这都跟肝脏有关系，禁忌归禁忌，你还是可以用蛇蜕，你可以开一些疏肝的药在里面，比如说柴胡、川芎、白芍、郁金，都可以开在里面。我常常开的是蛇蜕五分、蝉蜕五分，一对一起用."}]},{"ID":"20240204145438-2hmmui9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204145438-2hmmui9"}}]}